OL,3,CMan accused of killing Scottish aid
OL,4,Cworker in Athens expected back in court
OL,6,FA man accused of killing a Scottish
OL,7,Faid worker and disposing of her body
OL,8,Fin a suitcase is expected to return to
OL,9,Fcourt in Athens on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe 26-year-old is accused of killing
OL,12,FElisabeth-Jane Ross, 38, who was
OL,13,Fdiscovered by a homeless man in a
OL,14,Fderelict building in the Kypseli area
OL,15,Fof the Greek capital on July 18.
OL,17,FHe is understood to be Sharif
OL,18,FAhmadzai, an Afghan boxer who left his
OL,19,Fhome country after being orphaned as a
OL,20,Fteenager.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
