FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785989891
OL,3,CMan accused of killing Scottish aid
OL,4,Cworker in Athens expected back in court
OL,6,FAhmadzai appeared in court in Athens
OL,7,Fon Wednesday morning, having arrived
OL,8,Fin an unmarked car accompanied by
OL,9,Fmasked police officers.
OL,11,FDuring the private hearing, it is
OL,12,Funderstood he was assigned a court-
OL,13,Fappointed lawyer and given time to
OL,14,Fprepare his defence.
OL,16,FThe court is located on the city's
OL,17,FEvelpidon Street, a short walk from
OL,18,Fwhere the charity worker's body was
OL,19,Ffound.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785989891
OL,3,CMan accused of killing Scottish aid
OL,4,Cworker in Athens expected back in court
OL,6,FAhmadzai was initially detained on
OL,7,Fillegal weapons possession charges and
OL,8,Fis facing a charge of homicide with
OL,9,Fintent, as well as allegations that he
OL,10,Fstole more than 10,000 euro (#8,500)
OL,11,Ffrom the victim's bank accounts using
OL,12,Fher bank cards, police said.
OL,14,FGreek officials said he admitted
OL,15,Fmoving the body but denied the
OL,16,Fhomicide allegations.
OL,18,FHomicide with intent is understood to
OL,19,Fbe equivalent to a murder charge in
OL,20,FScotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785989891
OL,3,CMan accused of killing Scottish aid
OL,4,Cworker in Athens expected back in court
OL,6,FFloral tributes have been placed
OL,7,Foutside the abandoned building where
OL,8,FMs Ross's body was discovered.
OL,10,FOne had a card with the words "Rest in
OL,11,Fpeace" written in Greek.
OL,13,FThe derelict structure at 7 Evelpidon
OL,14,FStreet is heavily graffitied, missing
OL,15,Fa number of windows and is surrounded
OL,16,Fby tall metal barriers.
OL,18,FPolice said the suspect was detained
OL,19,Ffor questioning after investigators
OL,20,Freviewed surveillance camera footage
OL,21,Frecorded nearby.
OL,26,@rD@_OUsD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
